  "summary": "The Troy, NY City Council overrode Mayor Carmella Mantello's veto of legislation limiting Flock Safety ALPR data retention to 72 hours, and is also suing the mayor over what it alleges is an illegal Flock contract. If the court voids the contract, Troy could issue an RFP for a different ALPR vendor or redirect funds elsewhere.",
